{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>日本東京明治神宮外苑的銀杏林一片金黃，周六（21日）吸引大批遊人前往。秋天氣溫下降時銀杏開始變色，至11、12月完成由綠至黃的蛻變，進入理想觀賞期。（綜合報道）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T07:23:53.265347+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T06:52:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T11:57:34.979158+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T07:17:26.138881+00:00","content_hash":"37cab805b37f0bb48d02c262925a6a4057853b53739cd03e4104c0c3a3b59905","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}